WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.266 --> 00:00:01.534 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Welcome back.
-Yeah, thanks for having me.

00:00:01.534 --> 00:00:03.336 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Always so great to see you.
-Thank you. Thank you.

00:00:03.336 --> 00:00:05.839 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I do want to clear
something up right away.

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.107 line:92%
Sometimes I'm a little unsure

00:00:07.107 --> 00:00:08.375 align:start size:94% position:6%
what to call you
when you come out.

00:00:08.375 --> 00:00:09.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's Love.
-It's Love.

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:10.443 align:start size:94% position:6%
So, it is Love.
-Yes.

00:00:10.443 --> 00:00:11.878 align:start size:94% position:6%
-'Cause I heard you changed
your name to Love,

00:00:11.878 --> 00:00:14.914 align:start size:94% position:6%
and then I heard you say
it wasn't your name;
it was an alter ego.

00:00:14.914 --> 00:00:18.485 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's an alter ego,
but I did change my name.

00:00:18.485 --> 00:00:22.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
I changed my mind about saying
I didn't change my name.

00:00:22.222 --> 00:00:23.023 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.023 --> 00:00:27.427
And I have become everything
I've always wanted to be --

00:00:27.427 --> 00:00:28.395 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Love.

00:00:28.395 --> 00:00:29.729 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-Okay. That's fantastic.

00:00:29.729 --> 00:00:31.765 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:31.765 --> 00:00:34.701 align:start size:94% position:6%
Here's the thing.
If I hypothetically --

00:00:34.701 --> 00:00:36.202 line:92%
-Can I see these on you, please?

00:00:36.202 --> 00:00:38.238 line:92%
-Yeah, of course. Happily.

00:00:38.238 --> 00:00:40.073 size:84% position:42% line:92%
So, how is it? Not bad?

00:00:40.073 --> 00:00:43.276 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:43.276 --> 00:00:46.346 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Don't be afraid.
-I won't be afraid.

00:00:46.346 --> 00:00:47.547 line:92%
But hypothetically, let's say

00:00:47.547 --> 00:00:49.516
I'm writing you a Christmas card
next year.

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:51.184 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm afraid
if I address it to Love,

00:00:51.184 --> 00:00:53.486 line:92%
it won't be your name anymore.

00:00:53.486 --> 00:00:54.788 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.788 --> 00:00:56.222 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Possibly.
-Okay. Possibly.

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.091 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, as long as the address
is the same.

00:00:58.091 --> 00:00:59.759 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, you can call me
Diddy or Puff.

00:00:59.759 --> 00:01:01.261 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's just another part
of my alter ego.

00:01:01.261 --> 00:01:04.898
And it's me evolving and
having a little bit of fun.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:06.299 align:start size:94% position:6%
But I'm really
taking it seriously.

00:01:06.299 --> 00:01:08.601
It started out as something
I was playing around with,

00:01:08.601 --> 00:01:12.772
but, you know, it was something
that I evolved into in my life.

00:01:12.772 --> 00:01:16.176
And now I'm fully embracing it.
Why wouldn't I?

00:01:16.176 --> 00:01:17.510 align:start size:94% position:6%
Whose name doesn't
want to be Love?

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:21.314 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I agree with you.
"Late night with Love Meyers."

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:22.715 line:92%
So, tell me about "The Four."

00:01:22.715 --> 00:01:25.518
This is an idea you came up with
to have this show.

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:29.022 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, it was an idea
that came from overseas.

00:01:29.022 --> 00:01:29.489 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Okay.

00:01:29.489 --> 00:01:32.158
-And Fox picked it up, and they
asked me to be a part of it.

00:01:32.158 --> 00:01:34.828
-Great.
-And it is probably the most --

00:01:34.828 --> 00:01:35.829 size:78% position:39% line:92%
It is not "probably."

00:01:35.829 --> 00:01:39.332 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's the most disruptive,
freshest, newest

00:01:39.332 --> 00:01:41.668 align:start size:94% position:6%
vocal competition show
that's out there.

00:01:41.668 --> 00:01:43.803 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's not a vocal competition.
-Okay.

00:01:43.803 --> 00:01:46.306 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It's a vocal battle.
-Oh. That's the difference.

00:01:46.306 --> 00:01:48.108 line:92%
-Yeah, there's a difference.

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:49.109 line:92%
'Cause there's four seats

00:01:49.109 --> 00:01:53.746
that already have four of
the best singers in them.

00:01:53.746 --> 00:01:55.215 size:81% position:41% line:92%
And somebody from home

00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:58.318 size:78% position:39%
can audition by going
to TheFourMusic.com.

00:01:58.318 --> 00:02:01.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
We look at their audition.
We have them come.

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:02.922 line:92%
If they make it past the judges,

00:02:02.922 --> 00:02:04.824 line:92%
which is myself, D.J. Khaled,

00:02:04.824 --> 00:02:07.293 align:start size:94% position:6%
Meghan Trainor,
and Charlie Walk,

00:02:07.293 --> 00:02:09.162 line:92%
then they get to challenge.

00:02:09.162 --> 00:02:10.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
Challenge!
-Yeah.

00:02:10.497 --> 00:02:12.899 align:start size:94% position:6%
-They get to challenge
for a seat.

00:02:12.899 --> 00:02:17.537
So that's like a young comedian
coming and walking in here

00:02:17.537 --> 00:02:18.505 size:88% position:44% line:92%
and saying, "Challenge!"

00:02:18.505 --> 00:02:20.507 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
That's why I have security.

00:02:20.507 --> 00:02:22.208 align:start size:94% position:6%
I don't ever
want that to happen.

00:02:22.208 --> 00:02:25.545
-Yeah. [ Laughs ]
-I don't want to be challenged.

00:02:25.545 --> 00:02:28.648 align:start size:94% position:6%
And there's some
trash-talking, though.

00:02:28.648 --> 00:02:30.016 align:start size:94% position:6%
Do you encourage
the trash-talking

00:02:30.016 --> 00:02:32.986 size:78% position:39%
between the young'uns
and the established?

00:02:32.986 --> 00:02:36.789 line:92%
-I definitely encourage passion.

00:02:36.789 --> 00:02:37.257 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:37.257 --> 00:02:40.793 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I definitely encourage
trash-talking.

00:02:40.793 --> 00:02:41.694 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay.
-Yes.

00:02:41.694 --> 00:02:44.631 size:81% position:41%
-You put together --
-I love trash-talking.

00:02:44.631 --> 00:02:48.735 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes. It seems to be
something that you enjoy.

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:52.372
Uh, D.J. Khaled -- you convinced
him to do this, yes?

00:02:52.372 --> 00:02:53.473 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yes.
-Did you feel like

00:02:53.473 --> 00:02:56.276
when you put this together that
you had to get the right judges?

00:02:56.276 --> 00:02:58.845 align:start size:94% position:6%
And how did you convince him
to be one of your judges?

00:02:58.845 --> 00:03:00.813 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I mean, for me,
returning back to television,

00:03:00.813 --> 00:03:03.983
I wanted to do it in a way
that would give the fans,

00:03:03.983 --> 00:03:06.452 align:start size:94% position:6%
you know, more than what
they bargained for.

00:03:06.452 --> 00:03:08.655 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I didn't want it to be
all relying on me.

00:03:08.655 --> 00:03:10.290 align:start size:94% position:6%
So I wanted to build
a super team.

00:03:10.290 --> 00:03:12.258 align:start size:94% position:6%
I took a page
out of LeBron James' --

00:03:12.258 --> 00:03:14.227 align:start size:94% position:6%
I mean Dwyane Wade's book.
-Yeah.

00:03:14.227 --> 00:03:15.395 size:81% position:41% line:92%
-Getting LeBron James.

00:03:15.395 --> 00:03:18.364 align:start size:94% position:6%
And I just wanted
to put together a panel

00:03:18.364 --> 00:03:21.034 size:84% position:42%
that I felt would be
extremely entertaining.

00:03:21.034 --> 00:03:24.337
And I'm-a just let you all know
there's nobody out there

00:03:24.337 --> 00:03:27.273 align:start size:94% position:6%
that's more entertaining
than me, Khaled,

00:03:27.273 --> 00:03:29.275 align:start size:94% position:6%
Meghan Trainor,
and Charlie Walk.

00:03:29.275 --> 00:03:32.645 align:start size:94% position:6%
You have to check it out.
Thursday nights. 8:00 on Fox.

00:03:32.645 --> 00:03:36.249 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Perfect. There you go.
-Yeah.

